1
00:00:00,116 --> 00:00:02,176
It's the avoidant one, who learned

2
00:00:02,196 --> 00:00:04,096
from childhood that when she cries,

3
00:00:04,116 --> 00:00:05,216
no one comforts her,

4
00:00:05,236 --> 00:00:06,336
that there is no love for her,

5
00:00:06,356 --> 00:00:08,176
that she has to do everything alone.

6
00:00:08,196 --> 00:00:09,216
So she learns

7
00:00:09,236 --> 00:00:11,456
that depending on someone is dangerous,

8
00:00:11,476 --> 00:00:12,256
that it hurts.

9
00:00:12,276 --> 00:00:13,296
And her whole life

10
00:00:13,316 --> 00:00:16,384
she avoids depending on anyone.

11
00:00:16,404 --> 00:00:18,830
Extremes are never healthy.
